{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 6.2 x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>6.2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when&nbsp;<math alttext=\"x equals 10\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>?</p>", "keys": ["0e2790b3-fc2a-4f61-a640-537c1588321d"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "7d478441-0e2b-470f-876b-11a0dc8ba97e", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"72\"><mn>72</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "0e2790b3-fc2a-4f61-a640-537c1588321d", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"62\"><mn>62</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "4d47caf5-d905-4a11-b39c-9fdeaa840b5b", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"17.2\"><mn>17.2</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "b14b0a4c-390a-42dc-bbf3-6bdb056850f7", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"16.2\"><mn>16.2</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p>Choice B is correct. It's given that the function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 6.2 x\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6.2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>. The value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 10\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> can be found by substituting <math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 6.2 x\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6.2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, which&nbsp;yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 10 right parenthesis equals 6.2 left parenthesis 10 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6.2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 10 right parenthesis equals 62\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn></math>. Therefore, when <math alttext=\"x equals 10\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math alttext=\"62\"><mn>62</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 10 right parenthesis plus 10\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, not the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 10\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"6.2 plus 10\"><mn>6.2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, not the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 10\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>", "externalid": "3f8715bd-7d20-480b-a809-bd3b31a8df26", "correct_answer": ["B"]}